Z||000002||Philphine||03-10-2001||01:14 PM||||hey count, i think i gave this answer once before, but try hunt and knight in j-town (kind of eastern part of jefferson county, in the bluegrass industrial park area). they work exclusively on gm and have a reputation for corvette repair. i've had my fiero there twice for pretty major work and they didn't gripe over the cars rep or make snide remarks about it. they've always explained what they did to me and if i get there while they're working on it show me what they are doing or if they have a similar car up on the lift show me what area they are working on. might have to throw a little more money at them but short of having a personal mechanic friend i think they are pretty trustworthy.<P>hmmm... i should get a cut of the profits for that recommendation. tell 'em phil sent ya.<P>they'll probaly say "who?"     ||||reg||1
